+# Turn Usage Arithmetic
+
+| Field  | Value                |
+| ------ | -------------------- |
+| Issue  | re-cinq/HALEngine#93 |
+| Status | Shipped              |
+
+This specification defines the arithmetic used to combine provider usage within a turn.
+
+## Combining reported rounds
+
+- The turn usage accumulator sums input, output and total token fields from reported rounds, skips missing usage, and returns `undefined` when no round reports usage ([validated by: sums reported token fields and skips missing rounds](../../src/orchestration/turnUsage.test.ts#L5)).
+
+- The orchestrator includes the tool-request provider call in the usage delivered to the response hook ([validated by: includes the tool-request call in hook usage](../../src/orchestration/turnUsageContract.test.ts#L7)).
+
+- Missing provider usage is skipped while a turn with no reported usage remains undefined ([validated by: counts reported rounds while leaving a turn with no reported usage undefined](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestratorUsage.acceptance.test.ts#L67)).
